Lolly patch 0003: brand faces.

Why: Lolly tools use the active design system's faces only. Every hardcoded
font stack becomes var(--font-brand) or var(--font-mono); style.css defines
both from upstream's own stacks, and the utility overrides them at boot with
the design system's stacks (the font files themselves are registered with
FontFace inside the frame, so the frame never fetches a font).

Applied by scripts/vendor-rondocode.ts with git apply --directory=packages/rondo/upstream.

